# TEAM-14 · The one-shot sessions: a second read of a change, and a commit
# message for it (real Claude Code).
start --budget 2
see any key: close
key Escape
key /
type Add a one-line docstring to Shelf.__len__ in shelf.py. One worker on the cheap tier.
key Enter
key Escape Escape
allow 600 ready to approve || look first
# The repository's check asks once the change is read; then it ran.
allow 300 ✓ check
key g d
type :review
key Enter
# The note stands above the change's files.
key Enter
wait 240 ✎ review · || ✎ claude-review || review ·
type :review
key Enter
see no review:
key Escape
key g d
key a
allow 120 ALL DONE
type :commit
key Enter
wait 120 !git commit -m '
gone Nothing for me to do here.
key C-u Escape
